// the class name with that suffix removed:
//
//   filters:
//     - ApiKey=X-Api-Key
//
// Get the suffix wrong and startup fails with
//   Unable to find GatewayFilterFactory with name ApiKey

// Modifying the response correctly - beforeCommit, not then()
